    "review": {
      "date": "2026-09-16",
      "form": "20260916_KiCad_Golden_Spec_Review_Points_FilledForm.docx",
      "netclass_source": "a devboard settings export (a 6-layer devboard project)",
      "notes": [
        "Q-04: netclasses defined before routing; table adopted verbatim",
        "Q-03: tuning corner_style set to chamfer (2) so boards carry zero arcs; verify the label in Board Setup > Length-tuning patterns",
        "rev D: min_through_hole_diameter harmonized to 0.15 to match the Default/BUS netclass via drill; apply_settings --fab resets it to the active profile value (JLCPCB 2-layer raises rule and class drills to 0.30)",
        "rev H (2026-09-18): High-Density Via Allowance - on fabricator profiles with layers >= 4 the profile's min_via_diameter / min_via_annular_width REPLACE the template values (JLCPCB 4L/6L: 0.25 / 0.05) and the profile's minimum via is added to via_dimensions. The template keeps 0.45 / 0.1 as the no-fabricator default; 2-layer is unaffected because its profile limits are stricter.",
        "rev I (2026-09-18): keepout enumeration covers footprint-internal rule areas; the audit reports the keepout count explicitly, including zero.",
        "rev J (2026-09-19): routability pre-flight (route_report.py), --auto-clearance so footprint-local overrides reach the DSN, route_sweep.py to measure the clearance, and a padstack integrity gate on SES import. Netclass clearance - not min_clearance - is what the DSN carries.",
        "rev K (2026-09-19): templates are design-independent - netclass patterns and per-project lists ship empty, because an inherited rule that matches nothing reports a pass while auditing nothing. netclass_propose.py derives rails from the netlist; the audit FAILs on an unclassed rail.",
        "rev L (2026-09-19): opt-in priority-based iterative routing. The lock contract (SetLocked -> DSN (type fix) -> honoured by Freerouting) is verified by fingerprint, and the measured trade - critical-net vias halved, ~10 more unrouted - is recorded as one board's observation, not a default.",
        "rev M (2026-09-20): autorouter costs move from GUI session state into the project via a generated .rules file (-dr). The design name must be QUOTED or the file is silently ignored. Measured: via_costs 50 -> 150 cut key-net vias 24 -> 11, matching what two-phase routing achieved with far more machinery."
      ]
    }
  },
